{"answerArea":{"calculator":false,"chi2Table":false,"periodicTable":false,"tTable":false,"zTable":false},"hints":[{"content":"To factor means to rewrite an expression as a product. Let's try dividing the expression $72y+108z$ by each factor.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"####Factoring out $9$\n\n$\\begin{align}\n\u0026\\phantom{=}72y+108z\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=9\\left(\\dfrac{72y+108z}{9}\\right)\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=9\\left(\\dfrac{72y}{9}+\\dfrac{108z}{9}\\right) \\\\\\\\\n\u0026=9(8y+12z)\n\\end{align}$\n\nNo, $72y+108z$ is *not* equivalent to $9(7y+12z)$.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"####Factoring out $36$\n\n$\\begin{align}\n\u0026\\phantom{=}72y+108z\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=36\\left(\\dfrac{72y+108z}{36}\\right)\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=36\\left(\\dfrac{72y}{36}+\\dfrac{108z}{36}\\right) \\\\\\\\\n\u0026=36(2y+3z)\n\\end{align}$\n\nYes, $72y+108z$ is equivalent to $36(2y+3z)$.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"####Factoring out $6$\n\n$\\begin{align}\n\u0026\\phantom{=}72y+108z\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=6\\left(\\dfrac{72y+108z}{6}\\right)\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=6\\left(\\dfrac{72y}{6}+\\dfrac{108z}{6}\\right) \\\\\\\\\n\u0026=6(12y+18z)\n\\end{align}$\n\nNo, $72y+108z$ is *not* equivalent to $6(18y+12z)$.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"####Factoring out $12$\n\n$\\begin{align}\n\u0026\\phantom{=}72y+108z\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=12\\left(\\dfrac{72y+108z}{12}\\right)\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=12\\left(\\dfrac{72y}{12}+\\dfrac{108z}{12}\\right) \\\\\\\\\n\u0026=12(6y+9z)\n\\end{align}$\n\nYes, $72y+108z$ is equivalent to $12(6y+9z)$.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"The following expressions are equivalent to $72y+108z$:\n\n- $36(2y+3z)$\n- $12(6y+9z)$","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}}],"itemDataVersion":{"major":0,"minor":1},"question":{"content":"**Factor $72y+108z$ to identify the equivalent expressions.**\n\n[[☃ radio 1]]","images":{},"widgets":{"radio 1":{"alignment":"default","graded":true,"options":{"choices":[{"clue":"This expression is equivalent to $63y+108z$.","content":"$9(7y+12z)$","correct":false},{"clue":"This expression is equivalent to $72y+108z$.","content":"$36(2y+3z)$","correct":true},{"clue":"This expression is equivalent to $108y+72z$.","content":"$6(18y+12z)$","correct":false,"isNoneOfTheAbove":false},{"clue":"This expression is equivalent to $72y+108z$.","content":"$12(6y+9z)$","correct":true,"isNoneOfTheAbove":false}],"countChoices":true,"deselectEnabled":false,"displayCount":null,"hasNoneOfTheAbove":false,"multipleSelect":true,"randomize":false},"static":false,"type":"radio","version":{"major":1,"minor":0}}}}}
